    {
      "id": "far-cf-start-and-revenue-c2",
      "heading": "Transaction 2: exchanging one asset for others",
      "explanation_md": "Circle Films buys a **video camera for ₹9,000** and **memory cards for ₹1,000.**\n\nThe company is **exchanging one asset (cash) for other assets (equipment and supplies)**. Assets both increase and decrease by ₹10,000, so the **net effect is no change in total assets**.\n\nTable: Cash ₹15,000 - ₹10,000 = ₹5,000; Supplies +₹1,000; Equipment +₹9,000. Total assets ₹15,000 = ₹0 + ₹15,000.",
      "example_ids": [
